"speculative decoding, P/D disaggregation, and MLAPO on the model and "
"hardware combinations documented by vLLM Ascend. The following table shows "
"whether each feature can be combined with DCP across devices and attention "
"backends:"
msgstr ""
"DCP在vLLM "
"Ascend记录的模型和硬件组合上支持eager和图执行、前缀缓存、分块预填充、推测解码、P/D分离以及MLAPO。下表显示了各功能在设备和注意力后端上是否可以与DCP组合使用："

msgid ""
"| Device | Attention Backend | Chunked Prefill + DCP | Prefix Caching + DCP "
"| Graph Mode + DCP | P/D Disaggregation + DCP | MLAPO + DCP | Speculative "
"Decoding + DCP |"
msgstr ""
"| 设备 | 注意力后端 | 分块预填充 + DCP | 前缀缓存 + DCP | 图模式 + DCP | P/D分离 + DCP | MLAPO + "
"DCP | 推测解码 + DCP |"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid "DCP reuses the TP devices and does not increase the world size."
msgstr "DCP复用TP设备，不会增加世界大小。"

msgid ""
"- For an MLA model such as DeepSeek-R1:\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- For a GQA model such as Qwen3-235B:\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- In a KV-cache transfer scenario such as KV pooling or P/D disaggregation, set `cp_kv_cache_interleave_size` to the KV-cache `block_size` (default: 128):"
msgstr ""
"- 对于MLA模型（如DeepSeek-R1）：\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `tensor_parallel_size % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- 对于GQA模型（如Qwen3-235B）：\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) >= decode_context_parallel_size`\n"
"    - `(tensor_parallel_size // num_key_value_heads) % decode_context_parallel_size == 0`\n"
"- 在KV缓存传输场景（如KV池化或P/D分离）中，将`cp_kv_cache_interleave_size`设置为KV缓存的`block_size`（默认值：128）："

msgid "# Context Parallel Guide"
msgstr "# 上下文并行指南"

msgid ""
"DSA-CP supports prefix caching, chunked prefill, speculative decoding, P/D "
"disaggregation on the model and hardware combinations documented by vLLM "
"Ascend."
msgstr "DSA-CP支持vLLM Ascend文档中记录的模型和硬件组合上的前缀缓存、分块预填充、推测解码和P/D分离。"

msgid "### DSA-CP"
msgstr "### DSA-CP"

msgid ""
"For implementation details, see the [Context Parallel design "
"document](../../developer_guide/Design_Documents/context_parallel.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关实现细节，请参阅[上下文并行设计文档](../../developer_guide/Design_Documents/context_parallel.md)。"

msgid ""
"Context Parallel (CP) serves long-context requests by splitting work or KV-"
"cache storage along the sequence dimension:"
msgstr "上下文并行（CP）通过沿序列维度拆分工作或KV缓存存储来服务长上下文请求："

msgid ""
"- Prefill Context Parallel (PCP) splits the prefill tokens of a long prefill request across additional ranks. Each rank computes a different part of the sequence, reducing time to first token (TTFT).\n"
"- Decode Context Parallel (DCP) shards the KV cache across ranks in a DCP group, which may reuse ranks from the PCP group, the Tensor Parallel (TP) group, or both, depending on the parallel configuration. It reduces duplicated KV-cache storage and can increase decode throughput."
msgstr ""
"- 预填充上下文并行（PCP）将长预填充请求的预填充令牌拆分到额外的秩上。每个秩计算序列的不同部分，从而减少首令牌时间（TTFT）。\n"
"- 解码上下文并行（DCP）将KV缓存分片到DCP组中的各秩上，该组可能复用PCP组、张量并行（TP）组或两者的秩，具体取决于并行配置。它减少了重复的KV缓存存储，并可以提高解码吞吐量。"

msgid ""
"For a general introduction to these two strategies, see the upstream [vLLM "
"Context Parallel "
"Deployment](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/context_parallel_deployment/)"
" guide."
msgstr ""
"有关这两种策略的通用介绍，请参阅上游[vLLM上下文并行部署](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/context_parallel_deployment/)指南。"

msgid "### Prefill Context Parallel"
msgstr "### 预填充上下文并行"

