msgid ""
"To try PCP with the same world size, replace TP size `N > 1` with\n"
"`--tensor-parallel-size 1 --prefill-context-parallel-size N` and remove\n"
"`enable_dsa_cp` from `additional_config`. With TP size 1, PCP requires additional\n"
"ranks. Check the compatibility and limitations above before migrating."
msgstr ""
